===Etymology===
{{PIE root|en|krey}}
From {{bor|en|fro|acertener}}, from {{m|fro|a-||to, towards}} + {{m|fro|certener||make sure of}}, from the adjective {{m|fro|certain}}, from {{der|en|la|certus||certain, fixed}}. Compare to Spanish {{m|es|acertar}}.

